WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.060
Wanko.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.390
What I just heard in the house...

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:11.860
Don't tell me...

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.620
You know, it's always been my dream.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.920
That is... to have my fated zombie girl...

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.170
Eh?

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.280
You're not a zombie.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.190
Huh?

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.490
R-Rea.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.500
Why?

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.900
Why are you here?

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.950
Because this is Furuya-kun's dream,

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.030
this is a place where Furuya-kun's wishes can come true.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:59.170
After all, this is Furuya-kun's moe situation.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:00:59.910
Eh?

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:07.420
My moe situation.

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.170
That is...

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.930
She really granted my wish.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:20.280
Eh?

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.480
Babu.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:02.410
Hey, did you hear another scream?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.580
Yes, that voice was definitely Ranko-dono's.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.830
But Nii went to check on her, so there is no cause for concern.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.330
Ah, is that so.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.860
H-Hey! What is going on here, Chihiro?!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.490
Why is Sanka-san, who ran away, here in your room?

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.490
Um. Well...

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:48.040
Also, she's injured quite badly, isn't she?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.410
Yet, you've left her in your room and haven't taken her to the hospital.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.870
What exactly are you thinking...

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.840
That's it, after all, isn't it?

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.880
She's a zombie, isn't she?

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.010
Wanko...

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.020
There's a good reason for all of this.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.690
You murderer!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:17.900
You!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:21.690
How could you murder someone for your experiments?!

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:23.530
Wait, hold on!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.610
It's not like that.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.070
How is it not like that?
It's not like that.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.490
Wa-

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.120
Hey!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.490
Police! Police!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.290
Listen to me!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.370
Babu.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.720
Answer me!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.300
What exactly is going on here?

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.380
Like I've been saying, it was an accident.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.220
She took the drug and...

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.430
More importantly, Rea's acting strange and...

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.310
Babu...

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.820
W-Wait, Rea.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.490
Where are you going?

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:03.280
Dammit.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.280
Wanko, go get Grandpa out of the bath.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.410
Eh? Why?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.950
Just do it.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:10.910
Wait a moment.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:15.290
I don't get along well with Grandpa.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.080
What exactly is going on here?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.340
Hey, Chihiro.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.420
What was that scream about?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.550
Is everything okay?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.880
It's nothing.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.550
Wanko was just scared by a DVD she was watching.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:33.390
What exactly are you doing up there?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.060
Skipping out on cleaning?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.690
No, it's just because Babu ran off and...

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.190
That again...

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:41.900
Hurry back.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.610
Yeah.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.620
Eh? They're not here.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.200
They couldn't have...

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:04.630
Eh?

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:08.300
They're eating the hydrangeas.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.060
Um, why are they eating those...

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:16.060
Huh?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.560
Rea's eyes.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.310
Her pupils are...

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:27.110
Huh?

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.240
I...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:34.160
Ah, Furuya... kun?

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.250
She seems to have regained consciousness.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:37.870
Rea!

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:48.260
Why am I outside like this?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.090
Hold on a moment.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.970
Put this on.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.100
When she ate the hydrangea, she regained consciousness.

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:01.730
I get it.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.770
The hydrangea's toxin is the key ingredient in the resurrection drug.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:10.820
That's why eating it extends the effects of the drug.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.410
I get it.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:20.410
Both Rea and Babu are putting the toxin back into their bodies.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.700
Eh?

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:22.670
Toxin?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.800
Hm, as expected of my grandkid.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.930
I brought him.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:31.550
Grandpa.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.350
As I thought, the one who gave Sada the resurrection pill...

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.640
...and brought her back to life was Chihiro, wasn't it?

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.680
Like I said, Sada...

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.390
Does he mean Rea?

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.060
Who is he mistaking her for?

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:44.900
Listen.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.480
That resurrection pill isn't complete.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.820
If you take it only once and don't do anything,

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.820
eventually you'll lose your rationality and ability to move,

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:56.830
and in the end you'll end up dead like before.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:01.040
More importantly, Grandpa, get off my back already!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:04.000
What are you saying, Otoji, we're a married couple.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.500
I'm not Otoji!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:07.880
What are you guys doing?

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:12.380
In order to preserve the resurrected body you have to:

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.760
First, exercise properly.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.640
Second, live in a cold environment.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.060
Third, frequently replenish the hydrangea toxin.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.940
If that was the case, you should have just written that in the book.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:26.900
Fool.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:30.650
By steadily observing the daily actions of the resurrected,

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.110
you should be able to discover that with your own power.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.700
What kind of reason is that?

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.490
What are they talking about?

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:38.450
No idea.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:44.000
Anyway, to put it simply, does that mean their
bodies will stop rotting as long as I have hydrangea?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:44.960
No.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.710
Since that resurrection pill isn't complete,

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:53.380
even if you slow down the progression of decay,

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.590
you can't stop it.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.350
For that reason I...

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.270
Ah, I hit him.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.310
G-Grandpa.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.190
Grandpa!

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:09.940
Gra-

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.900
Grandpa...

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.320
Well, today is going to be glabrous sarcandra weather.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.030
Did he go back into stupid mode again?

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.990
Just when he was in the right state of mind.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:25.120
Sorry, I didn't really mean to...

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.130
Come on, Grandpa, let's go inside.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.710
Grandpa turned back into an idiot again,

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.890
but I learned a lot of important things.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.010
Insight...

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:47.140
Like I thought, I need to find a way to protect Rea's body on my own.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.980
By the way, Chihiro.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.900
Who's that girl?

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:56.150
Well, um, Tou-chan, the truth is, that girl...

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:59.660
You know, I thought I should consult you later on this, but that...

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:03.540
In the end, just thinking about it won't get me anywhere,

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:04.080
so I think I should tell you.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.460
That person is part of Furuya-kun's family.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.880
This is not good.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.670
They found out about me.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:16.670
I wonder if I will have to leave...

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.100
What is it, Chihiro?

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:26.810
Tou-chan, you see...

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.810
...she...

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.230
I want you to let Rea stay at our place.

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:35.230
Eh?

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:40.860
I want you to let Rea stay at our place.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:46.540
Well... I can't really explain the circumstances,

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:49.790
but she has nowhere else to go.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.130
Also, I...

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:52.500
I...

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.630
...need to take responsibility for her.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:00.840
T-That's why, Tou-chan...

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:03.510
Hm, circumstances...

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.890
Responsibility, huh?

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.020
Well, this certainly is rare,

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:18.150
seeing you so serious about something other than zombies.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.900
Ah, yeah.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.410
Though, this is also about zombies.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.780
I don't know what happened,

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:31.330
but the Shiryou Temple was originally used as a women's refuge.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.370
She can stay.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:32.920
Eh?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.170
I-It's really okay?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.300
Yeah, I really don't have a reason to turn her away.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.970
Thanks, Tou-chan.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.560
Hey, Rea, come on over here.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.890
I got permission from my father,

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:54.190
so from now on you can freely stay here.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.690
Eh?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:12:00.070
What, were you two already living together?

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.900
L-Living together?

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.200
It's not like that.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.490
Hm. Is that so?

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.750
Like I was saying, it wasn't...

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.750
I see.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.500
That person will be...

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.380
...a little bit difficult to deal with.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.260
Huh?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:30.390
You womaniser!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:31.890
Ah, that's right.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.020
I was on my way back home to help.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.940
But my apron is all torn up.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.860
Mum will likely scold me for it.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.280
I'm borrowing a shirt.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.530
See ya.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.370
Ah, also, give Sanka-san my regards.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.960
Rea will be staying here starting today.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:00.550
I decided to start keeping a journal,

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:07.840
since Grandpa said I should be "observing the daily actions of the resurrected."

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:12.810
Every day, I'm going to write down the things that we do together.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:19.440
By doing that, I might find a hint on how to
preserve Rea's body somewhere in our daily lives.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:20.900
With that hint, if I can find a way...

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.650
Um, excuse me.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.360
Hm?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.410
I'm sorry.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.870
It seems like I am continually creating a lot of problems for you, Furuya-kun.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.830
Well...

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.620
In the end, I was able to learn a bit more about zombie characteristics.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.130
U-Um?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.380
What is it?

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:43.800
Is it really okay for me to use Furuya-kun's room all by myself?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.010
Don't worry about it.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.380
You're part of the family now.

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.220
You know...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:53.310
I wouldn't mind sharing the room with Furuya-kun, too.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.930
No, about that...

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.690
Kissing was bad enough by itself.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.770
If we were together, something worse...

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.730
K-Kiss?!

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:03.650
What do you mean by "kiss"?

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:08.910
Somehow, it seems Rea doesn't remember what happened earlier.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.490
What? What happened?

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.290
No, it's nothing.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.910
It must have been my imagination...

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:18.960
Huh, don't tell me that when I blacked out,

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.580
you kissed me?

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:21.880
Wrong.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.960
That's what I should be saying.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.420
Ah, never mind...

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.430
What do you mean you should?

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.510
What am I?!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.680
That hurts!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.930
Like I said, that's wrong.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.480
If that is not it, then what is it?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.310
Calm down.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.110
What insane strength.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.820
Apparently her brain's strength limiter has been turned off.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.280
Nothing really happened, right?

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.450
Yeah.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:08.340
Nii is finally springing into his youth.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:12.890
In order to record the slight changes in Rea's condition,

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.600
I should also record it on video.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.190
No abnormalities on her thighs or the backs of her legs.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.900
Babu.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:25.520
Babu.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:30.400
Nor any abnormalities on the nape of her neck and upper arms.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:35.780
Furuya-kun, what are you doing?

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:36.780
Hm?

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.830
I'm documenting your changes as a zombie.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.080
Eh? I don't want that.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.130
It's embarrassing.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.590
That won't do, this is for your sake.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.880
From now on, I'm going to capture every bit of you on video.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.630
Come on, come on.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:53.800
Show me more.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.550
Show me.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.560
Even if this seems mean, I have to record it.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.810
Why are there green peppers in the miso soup?!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.820
Grandpa, it's eggplant.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.400
Eh. Is that so?

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.610
Hey, is that girl okay?

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.120
Hm? Ah.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.120
She said it's kind of embarrassing, so she'll eat alone.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.500
But I made enough for one more...

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:24.750
It's fine.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.130
Starting next time, it's not needed.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.750
She said she doesn't want to burden our family.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:32.090
She doesn't need to restrain herself that much.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:37.760
Could you please tell her I would be satisfied if she would happily join us for dinner?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.600
Yeah, I'll tell her.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.480
There are many different troublesome problems.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.810
Additionally, if she can't even taste it,

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.280
can she still imitate eating dinner?

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:55.160
Here, for the time being I brought some personal belongings.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:58.070
Eh, then stuff like underwear, too?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.390
Obviously I can't lend her my underwear,

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.410
so I'll go buy some tomorrow.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.290
See ya.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.080
Ah, Wanko.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.080
Hm?

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.880
Rea and I aren't like that.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:10.590
Seriously.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.010
Is that an excuse?

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:15.090
Like I said, it's not an excuse.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:16.640
I said I understand.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.640
See ya.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:18.510
Ah, Wanko.

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:20.260
What?

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.770
Thanks.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.860
For the time being, I can at least promise her a change of clothes.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.110
Well, since she doesn't have cellular metabolism,

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.530
she would probably be fine without the clothes.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:38.070
Even if I say so, Rea's feelings are still the same.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.040
Looking at her like that,

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.290
somehow it seems really depressing.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:56.760
After all, her existence is already different from the rest of ours.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.050
Furuya-kun.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.760
Ah, sorry.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.140
I brought your change of clothes.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:04.770
Thank you.

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.940
Basically, she's not living anymore.
Thank you.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:10.610
Hey.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.400
Hm?

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.170
Is this okay?

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:23.990
Walking like this.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:25.160
Don't worry about it.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:29.920
After all, Grandpa said you need to get some moderate exercise.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:30.420
Okay.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.920
Somehow, it was a strange scene to behold.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:41.550
To them, we probably looked like a normal couple.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:44.680
But she was a zombie.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:46.930
At first I was surprised.

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:49.980
I also thought it was my moe situation,

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.690
but looking at it like this, everything turned out the same.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.450
Whether a person or a zombie,

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.490
time passes by in the same fashion.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:12.830
Furuya-kun.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:14.500
Hm?

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.050
I have not needed to use the bathroom at all.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.680
Is that so.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.090
I also do not get sleepy at all.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.390
Well, after all...

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:28.730
I could not believe I was really dead.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:30.310
Yeah.

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.520
But, somehow I feel really happy.

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.190
If I had just died normally,

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.990
I would not know if the afterlife existed or not;

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.370
if I would become a ghost or not;

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:47.580
or, if I became one, if I would be able to walk like this.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.830
I probably would not be able to talk with Furuya-kun like this either.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.540
I may be well suited to being a zombie.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.670
Furuya-kun, thank you.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:04.050
Since I was able to meet you, I was able to become free again.

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.350
Although I am a zombie.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:11.430
But, with you like this, soon you will start to decay again.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.060
And then before long...

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.070
From now on...

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:20.400
...I'll properly take responsibility for you.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.820
Then...

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:30.660
From now on, please handle my body with care, okay, Furuya-kun?

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:34.080
You know, that way of speaking...

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.540
Eh? Is it strange?

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.790
It's strange. Definitely strange.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.380
Anyway, let's go.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.010
All right.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.800
Is there really a way to completely stop her body from decaying?

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:50.310
A way to maintain her body while still granting her desires.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:55.310
After all, once the hydrangea season ends...

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:00.820
Somehow, if I could just find more ways...

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.360
If I could just find another way...

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:10.540
Look out!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.670
That was dangerous.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.040
Are you okay? Furuya...

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:22.880
Furuya-kun! I'm sorry.

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:25.340
I... what did I do?

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.890
I'm fine.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.640
It seems like she left her mental limiter off again.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.350
Yeah, but...

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:36.390
This is terrible.

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:44.860
Hey, it's okay. I'm fine.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:51.450
If I do this, it will sterilise it.

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:43.940
Adjusting to fit in?

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:45.920
I understand.

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:47.650
Sorry I'm not used to it yet.

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:49.280
Today I'm just going with the flow.

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:52.280
It's okay because my mind is at ease.

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:53.990
Next time: Sankarea.

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.030
Episode 7: Childhood... Friend...

00:23:56.030 --> 00:24:00.290
Do you know the name of the famous zombie movie director who Furuya Chihiro's name is based off of?

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:03.040
Everyone, to find the right answer, search for Furuchi.

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:05.040
Eh?

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:09.800
Ah, there's some left. Eh?
